00:31:01.720 --> 00:31:09.780
So if you want to go back to the map, there isn't a map button or a menu that says, you know, take me to the map.

00:31:09.840 --> 00:31:13.520
You have to just take your mouse and bring it over to the map.

00:31:13.660 --> 00:31:16.900
And then you're the captain will stand over the map and then you.

00:31:17.020 --> 00:31:21.880
Yeah, you get access back to the map, you know, maybe a little convoluted.

