00:31:52.220 --> 00:31:56.360
Like it's all just a menu, but with with cute little drawings.

00:31:56.360 --> 00:32:04.180
And I just think it's really funny that it makes it seem like you're the only person on this on this submarine.

00:32:04.180 --> 00:32:07.120
Like you have to go down there and change this thing.

