But the, the, the, the way that this menu, I'm surprised more games don't do something

00:32:45.460 --> 00:32:50.780
like that. I mean, this could have just as easily been like a map icon, a periscope icon, you know,

00:32:50.880 --> 00:32:55.620
like the, your, what are your valves or whatever those are that all your readings, like an icon

00:32:55.620 --> 00:32:58.460
for that, an icon for checking damage.

00:32:58.720 --> 00:33:00.700
