00:33:00.700 --> 00:33:05.960
And, and I, and I imagine, I mean, this pretty much functionally as far as making a video

00:33:05.960 --> 00:33:12.700
game is, is just as, is, is not any like more robust to do.

00:33:12.860 --> 00:33:17.600
